  <main class="about-content">
    <h2>About Vinnie</h2>
    <div class="bio">
      Vinnie Amadeo was born and raised in Iowa and is currently incarcerated at California State Prison, Los Angeles County. From behind bars, he brings to life the often unseen world of prison through comics that reflect his personal experiences, challenges, and humorous takes on daily life. His goal isn’t to offend, but to entertain and share a slice of truth with a laugh. Each comic is a snapshot into a world most don’t get to see — raw, creative, and unfiltered. Drawing has become a way for him to connect with others and express his identity. With Slamcaster, he hopes to give voice to those behind the wall.
      <br />
      <img src="vinnie-headshot.png" alt="Vinnie Amadeo">
    </div>
